1132-## React / Web Vitals
1133-
1134-Requires `--enable react-devtools` at launch for the `react ...` commands.
1135:`vitals` and `pushstate` are framework-agnostic.
1136-
1137-```bash
1138-agent-browser open --enable react-devtools <url>    # Launch with React hook installed
1139-agent-browser react tree                            # Full component tree
