+# D05 late-morning verification — 2026-08-07
+
+Phase snapshot: `automation/logs/D05-2026-08-07-late-morning-facts.txt`, generated 2026-08-07 04:10:03 UTC / 10:10:02 site.
+
+## Frozen-snapshot comparison
+
+- The 06:10 and 10:10 site snapshots have byte-identical SLT subscription rows and recent-order rows.
+- Mailpit latest ID remained `1fEVaKxuFnCCLwCxNzeZ7G`.
+- Failed ArraySubs action section remained empty.
+- Settled D05 rows in the early report therefore remained supported; no completed setup or watch work was repeated.
+
+## Late-morning natural events
+
+### Paddle subscription 12639
+
+- At the 10:10 snapshot, invoice action 15234 and charge action 15235 were correctly still pending.
+- Action 15234 was scheduled for 2026-08-07 04:26:48 UTC / 10:26:48 site.
+- WP Cron started it at 04:27:03 UTC and completed it at 04:27:07 UTC.
+- It created exact relationship-owned renewal order 13044: `wc-pending`, `$11.00`, Paddle sandbox, `_renewal_cycle_number=3`, `_renewal_scheduled_date=2026-08-07 10:20:38`, subscription 12639.
+- Prior renewal order 12891 is cycle 2 and was not substituted for this D05 order.
+- Local charge action 15235 remains scheduled for 2026-08-07 10:26:48 UTC / 16:26:48 site.
+- Mailpit remained `1fEVaKxuFnCCLwCxNzeZ7G` immediately after the invoice leg, consistent with invoice-email suppression for an automatic-payment subscription.
+- Verdict at late-morning: `PENDING`, because remote/local settlement is after this phase's handoff.
+
+### Day/3 renewal reminder expectation
+
+- Exact live query found zero SLT subscriptions with `_next_payment_date` in the 2026-08-09 through 2026-08-10 UTC interval.
+- The D05 row's variable day/3 fixtures are source-absent per closed task 46 and are explicitly conditional-only elsewhere in the same row.
+- Sweep actions 15518 and 15520 are due at 10:37:04 and 10:42:04 site; their post-gate/no-mail evidence will be appended below.
+
+Post-gate result:
+
+- Action 15518 started/completed via WP Cron at 04:37:04–04:37:05 UTC / 10:37:04–10:37:05 site.
+- Action 15520 started/completed via WP Cron at 04:42:04–04:42:05 UTC / 10:42:04–10:42:05 site.
+- Neither sweep created a new `arraysubs_send_renewal_reminder` action for an SLT subscription.
+- Mailpit remained `1fEVaKxuFnCCLwCxNzeZ7G` through 10:42:38 site.
+- Verdict: `UNVERIFIED — source absent`, not a product-mail failure; the only authored D05 day/3 variation sources were closed absent/conditional by task 46.
+
+## SLT-EML-02 hard-gate preparation
+
+- Task 67 rolled to a valid D05 cycle and moved from `todo` to `in-progress`, claimed by `willow-swift`.
+- Resolved registry subscription: 11959; user 347 `slt-core`; product 11927 `SLT Daily Core`; parent order 11949.
+- Stable spread offset: 10727 seconds / 02:58:47.
+- Exact actions: invoice 15327 at 09:37:52 UTC / 15:37:52 site; charge 15328 at 15:37:52 UTC / 21:37:52 site.
+- Registry exception was appended/read back at 04:21:26 UTC / 10:21:26 site.
+- Exact prior `_auto_renew` state was absent, zero rows.
+- `PREV=1fEVaKxuFnCCLwCxNzeZ7G` was captured immediately before mutation.
+- At 04:22:03 UTC / 10:22:07 site, one exact `_auto_renew=off` row was saved; no immediate mail arrived.
+- Actions 15327/15328 were still pending/unattempted and no open renewal order existed at arm time.
+- Pending-leg UI proof: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-EML-02-01-pending-legs.png`.
+- Detailed pre-arm proof: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-EML-02-D05-prearm-state.txt` and `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-EML-02-registry-exception.txt`.
+
+## Post-gate append
+
+### SLT-MYA-02 target invoice leg
+
+- A valid owner-only baseline was captured at 11:14:26 site, inside the authored 11:14:21–11:19:20 final-five-minute window.
+- At baseline, action 15253 was pending and unattempted, subscription 12655 had no `_pending_renewal_order_id` and no relationship-owned pending order, retained Mastercard ending 4444, and Mailpit latest remained `1fEVaKxuFnCCLwCxNzeZ7G`.
+- Action 15253 was due at 11:19:21 site, started naturally via WP Cron at 11:20:06, and completed at 11:20:14.
+- The exact relationship query (`_subscription_id=12655`, `_renewal_scheduled_date=2026-08-07 10:44:10`, reverse `_subscription_renewal=12655`) uniquely resolved order 13047.
+- Order 13047 is `wc-pending`, cycle 3, `$9.00` USD, Stripe, created 11:20:07 site. Subscription 12655 remains active, has pending renewal order 13047, retains completed cycle count 2 and its unchanged next-payment date, and still references the new Mastercard ending 4444.
+- Mailpit remained unchanged from the final-five-minute baseline and no invoice-email guard appeared, as expected for an automatic-payment renewal.
+- Verdict: `PASS` for the target invoice leg. The authored charge observation remains gated at 17:19:21 site.
+
+### SLT-MYA-02 control invoice leg
+
+- A valid owner-only baseline was captured at 11:39:11 site, inside the authored 11:38:36–11:43:35 final-five-minute window.
+- At baseline, action 15266 was pending and unattempted, subscription 12234 had no relationship-owned pending order, retained Visa ending 4242 and its old payment-method reference, and Mailpit latest remained `1fEVaKxuFnCCLwCxNzeZ7G`.
+- Action 15266 was due at 11:43:36 site, started naturally via WP Cron at 11:44:04, and completed at 11:44:10.
+- Exact relationship and reverse-meta queries uniquely resolved pending renewal order 13050: cycle 5, scheduled date `2026-08-07 07:50:13` UTC, `$20.00` USD, Stripe, created 11:44:05 site.
+- Subscription 12234 remains active with completed cycle count 4 and unchanged next-payment date, points to pending order 13050, and still references Visa ending 4242 and the old payment method. Target order 13047 simultaneously retained Mastercard ending 4444 and the new payment method.
+- Both exact-order cardinalities were one. Neither order gained an invoice-email guard, and Mailpit remained globally unchanged from both final-five-minute baselines.
+- Verdict: `PASS` for the control invoice leg. The authored charge observations remain gated at 17:19:21 and 17:43:36 site.
